#: src/modules/alsa/alsa-sink.c:672 src/modules/alsa/alsa-sink.c:862
#, c-format
msgid ""
"ALSA woke us up to write new data to the device, but there was actually "
"nothing to write.\n"
"Most likely this is a bug in the ALSA driver '%s'. Please report this issue "
"to the ALSA developers.\n"
"We were woken up with POLLOUT set -- however a subsequent snd_pcm_avail() "
"returned 0 or another value < min_avail."
msgstr ""
"ALSA het ons wakker gemaak om nuwe data op die toestel te skryf, maar daar "
"was eintlik niks te skryf.\n"
"Heel waarskynlik is dit 'n bug in die ALSA bestuurder '%s'. Rapporteer "
"asseblief hierdie uitgawe om die ALSA ontwikkelaars.\n"
"Ons is wakker gemaak met POLLOUT set -- however a subsequent snd_pcm_avail() "
"returned 0 or another value < min_avail."

#: src/modules/alsa/alsa-source.c:636 src/modules/alsa/alsa-source.c:802
#, c-format
msgid ""
"ALSA woke us up to read new data from the device, but there was actually "
"nothing to read.\n"
"Most likely this is a bug in the ALSA driver '%s'. Please report this issue "
"to the ALSA developers.\n"
"We were woken up with POLLIN set -- however a subsequent snd_pcm_avail() "
"returned 0 or another value < min_avail."
msgstr ""
"ALSA het ons wakker gemaak om nuwe data van die toestel af te lees, maar "
"daar was eintlik niks om te lees.\n"
"Heel waarskynlik is dit 'n fout in die ALSA bestuurder '%s'. Rapporteer "
"asseblief hierdie uitgawe om die ALSA ontwikkelaars.\n"
"Ons is wakker gemaak met POLLOUT set -- however a subsequent snd_pcm_avail() "
"returned 0 or another value < min_avail."

#: src/modules/alsa/alsa-util.c:1183 src/modules/alsa/alsa-util.c:1277
#, c-format
msgid ""
"snd_pcm_avail() returned a value that is exceptionally large: %lu byte (%lu "
